target:    readme.txt
gate:      composer test:db-floor-metadata
kind:      restore-defect
expect:    has no `= 6.1.0 =` entry under `== Upgrade Notice ==`
rationale: Deletes the current Upgrade Notice entry and leaves a dateless changelog heading; only section-scoped extraction rejects it.
---
--- a/readme.txt
+++ b/readme.txt
@@ -161,5 +161,2 @@
 
-= 6.1.0 =
-Older versions keep working, added columns stay, and it removes no rows. Adds Copy Prompt, AI Analysis, city drilldown and video tutorials. SlimStat Pro now needs a valid, activated license. Fixes privacy exports, tracking, filters and geolocation. Back up first; repairs wait for your click.
-
 = 6.0.0 =
@@ -170,3 +167,3 @@
 
-= 6.1.0 - 2026-11-08 =
+= 6.1.0 =
 
